{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style='text-align: left; margin: 0px; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 13px; line-height: normal; font-family: \"Helvetica Neue\"; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-variation-settings: normal;'>梁芷珮（Christy）家庭事業兩得意，近日她在社交平台貼出長子 Brendan的香港大學畢業照。相中 Brendan 身穿畢業袍、手捧鮮花，與父母、弟妹及愛犬在港大校園留影，氣氛相當溫馨。</p><p style='text-align: left; margin: 0px; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 13px; line-height: normal; font-family: \"Helvetica Neue\"; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-variation-settings: normal; min-height: 15px;'></p><p style='text-align: left; margin: 0px; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 13px; line-height: normal; font-family: \"Helvetica Neue\"; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-variation-settings: normal;'>育有三子女的 Christy 見到長子大學畢業，坦言百感交集。她分享 Brendan 畢業上台的影片，並感性表示兒子從小懂事，讓她年紀輕輕生下他時也不必徬徨。她更叮囑兒子踏入社會後不要給自己太高壓力，並強調「屋企人永遠都係你嘅後盾」。</p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"SaveClipApp_612243961_18550604884024867_8450924757126976467_n_1200.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/07/2026QcsCd1UGEN1785125016.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"SaveClipApp_612243961_18550604884024867_8450924757126976467_n_1200.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n<div class=\"image-caption\" style=\"padding: 8px 12px; background: rgb(245, 247, 250); border-top-width: 1px; border-top-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(228, 231, 237); font-size: 12px; color: rgb(96, 98, 102); line-height: 1.5;\">\n<span class=\"img-description\">IG@imchristyleung</span>\n</div>\n</div><p style='text-align: left; margin: 0px; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 13px; line-height: normal; font-family: \"Helvetica Neue\"; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-variation-settings: normal;'>據悉，Brendan 不單成績優異，在 IBDP（國際文憑大學預科課程）考獲 34 分，獲加拿大多倫多大學社會科學系取錄，但他最終選擇了最心儀的港大新聞學學士課程，去年更曾遠赴丹麥擔任交換生。除了學業成績亮眼，Brendan 亦十分具運動天賦，過去曾為高爾夫球及軟式曲棍球（Floorball）的香港代表隊成員，絕對是文武雙全的傑出青年。</p><p style='text-align: left; margin: 0px; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 13px; line-height: normal; font-family: \"Helvetica Neue\"; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-feature-settings: normal; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-variation-settings: normal; min-height: 15px;'></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"imchristyleung_1784898527_3948326164984568431_145688866.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/07/2026SLRIyaFJRz1785125016.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"imchristyleung_1784898527_3948326164984568431_145688866.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n<div class=\"image-caption\" style=\"padding: 8px 12px; background: rgb(245, 247, 250); border-top-width: 1px; border-top-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(228, 231, 237); font-size: 12px; color: rgb(96, 98, 102); line-height: 1.5;\">\n<span class=\"img-description\">IG@imchristyleung</span>\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"imchristyleung_1784898527_3948326170974007384_145688866.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/07/2026RCayBW5g6O1785125016.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"imchristyleung_1784898527_3948326170974007384_145688866.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n<div class=\"image-caption\" style=\"padding: 8px 12px; background: rgb(245, 247, 250); border-top-width: 1px; border-top-style: solid; border-top-color: rgb(228, 231, 237); font-size: 12px; color: rgb(96, 98, 102); line-height: 1.5;\">\n<span class=\"img-description\">IG@imchristyleung</span>\n</div>\n</div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-27T04:18:21.151673+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":437,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}